_23NsVHp4XA&oe=6AC79686"}, {"file_name": "Gorilla_CHasing.png", "id": "1343170760592134", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310667_1343170763925467_2625165734147829836_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D2sXj_uEYioQ7kNvwHzOIvq&_nc_oc=AdobURbASaFIrOWK1DA0ZuaiCRDIwXjWMPxsMmGsRxahHPuZmODsW3z6LA_i4YNSI9g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNXNh8Q1x0j2GSmpKcbsoaj-VUakMZNFrzCOk7MCBP7Vg&oe=6AC7A52D"}, {"file_name": "Gorilla_Chaserssssss.png", "id": "4034041696729937", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507840145_4034041700063270_105011202233764348_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LCOx2SjSXI8Q7kNvwEv4UWA&_nc_oc=Adrhn2OJdCN0u4MjZxrCB7HkcEemjO5QJ7XtfuZhzdZt-J190Hd-b_DLvsBJU95P_ts&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM2UQ-z90fZEfQzwvfrys7xBdjwPOJGw_q9YIIHvW266Q&oe=6AC7B667"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ripple Taggers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "RIPPLE TAGGERS\n\nSwing, run, and scale your way to victory in Ripple Taggers, the ultimate fast-paced physics-based multiplayer tag game! Created by Direct, this game takes high-speed chase mechanics to the next level with incredibly smooth locomotion, customizable lobbies, and non-stop action.\n\n\ud83c\udf1f GAME FEATURES:\n\nCLASSIC LOCOMOTION: Master the iconic physics-based movement where your arms are your only tools to climb, jump, and escape other players.\n\nSHINY ROCKS & COSMETICS: Earn in-game currency as you play to unlock a massive catalog of epic cosmetics to customize your gorilla and show off your unique style.\n\nCUSTOM ROOMS & REGIONS: Instantly create and host private rooms using simple codes, broadcast your lobbies, and hang out with friends globally.\n\nFREQUENT UPDATES: Dive into fresh features, seasonal map rotations, and exciting new items designed to keep the chase thrilling.", "short_description": "RIPPLE TAGGE